Z||000030||Wannabe||06-26-2001||10:52 PM||||With regards to the potential of a turbo upgrade to the V6, the Fiero Shop in Toroto has a turbo'd 2.8 V6, completely stock from the pan to the covers - bolt on mods only, that was running consistent 13.4's before a tuning problem smoked some piston rings. This was after something like fifty runs down the 1/4 with the same set up, and with 12 lb of boost. Image the potential with a 3.1 or 3.4 with a stronger bottom end, some head work and a bit more boost. The mind boggles. Still hard to be the v8 "mystique" though, I will admit.||||reg||1
